.TH XBS 1 "September 2026" "xbs 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xbs \- open-source Apple Build & Integration (B&I) tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xbs
.B buildit
.RI [ options ]
.IR srcroot
.br
.B xbs
.B submitproject
.RI [ options ]
.IR srcroot
.br
.B xbs
.B vers
.RI [ path ]
.br
.B xbs
.B version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B xbs
is a reimplementation of Apple's build & integrate tools.
It builds Darwin projects the Apple B&I way: it establishes the
.B RC_*
build environment, shadow-builds a project from a pristine source copy,
records a reproducible sum of what was installed, verifies rebuilds
against that sum, and optionally merges or archives the built root.
Project-specific knowledge (Xcode aliases, dependencies, trains) lives in a
project database under
.IR conf ,
not in code.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS buildit
Build a Darwin project in the Apple B&I fashion.  Syntax:
.IP
.B xbs buildit
.RI [ options ]
.I srcroot
.PP
The pipeline is:
.IP
installsrc \(-> clean \(-> install \(-> verify \(-> sum [ \(-> merge ] [ \(-> archive ]
.PP
.TP
.BI \-arch\  name
Build for architecture
.I name
(repeatable; default: host architecture).
.TP
.BI \-project\  name ,   \-buildAlias\  name
Project name / xnu-style build alias (default: basename of srcroot).
.TP
.BI \-conf\  file
Project database.  Default:
.BR $XBS_CONF ,
.BR <bindir>/conf/projects.conf ,
or
.BR <bindir>/../share/xbs/conf/projects.conf .
.TP
.BI \-release\  train
Release train (name; sets
.BR RC_RELEASE ).
.TP
.BI \-version\  ver
Explicit source version (default: parsed from the path, else from
.B git describe
when the path carries no version).
.TP
.BI \-rootsDirectory\  dir
Place roots under
.I dir
(default:
.BR $XBS_ROOTS_DIR ,
else
.BR $TMPDIR ,
else
.BR /tmp ).
.TP
.BI \-sdk\  path
Override the SDK root.
.TP
.BI \-othercflags\  flags
Extra compile flags (sets
.BR RC_NONARCH_CFLAGS ;
falls back to
.BR XBS_CFLAGS ).
.TP
.BI \-target\  name
Override the make target (default:
.BR install ).
.TP
.BI \-os\  name
.IR RC_OS
override (default:
.BR MacOSX ).
.TP
.BI \-configuration\  name
Sets
.B RC_TARGET_CONFIG
(default:
.BR release ).
.TP
.BI \-env\  key=value
Pass a variable to the build environment (repeatable; overrides the RC_*
contract).
.TP
.BI \-parallel\  n
.IR make\ \-j
degree (default: CPU count).
.TP
.BI \-merge\  dst
Copy the built root on top of
.I dst
after install.
.TP
.B \-archive
Leave
.IR <proj>-<ver>~dst.tgz
of the built root beside the roots.
.TP
.B \-ignoreDependencies
Do not gate on missing dependency roots.
.TP
.B \-noinstallsrc
Build in place; do not shadow-copy sources.
.TP
.B \-noclean ,   \-nosum ,   \-noverify
Disable a pipeline phase.
.TP
.B \-verbose
Echo every command that runs.
.TP
.B \-n ,   \-dryrun
Dry run: print what would run, change nothing.
.TP
.B \-h
Show help.
.PP
Builds run with the RC_* environment contract: RC_XBS=YES,
RC_ProjectName, RC_ProjectSourceVersion, RC_ProjectNameAndSourceVersion,
RC_ProjectSourceSubversion=0, RC_BUILDING_INTERNAL=0, RC_OS, RC_RELEASE,
RC_TARGET_CONFIG, RC_CFLAGS, RC_NONARCH_CFLAGS, SRCROOT, OBJROOT, SYMROOT,
DSTROOT, SDKROOT, MAKEFLAGS=-jN, and INSTALL_DIR=/.
.SS submitproject
Package a project's sources as the B&I server would: stage a pristine,
junk-pruned copy under
.BI <output>/Software/<train>/Sources/<proj>-<ver>
and write a
.B .sum
manifest of the submission.
.TP
.BI \-project\  name
Project name (default: basename of srcroot).
.TP
.BI \-version\  ver
Source version (default: parsed from the path).
.TP
.BI \-release\  train
Train subdirectory (default:
.BR Current ).
.TP
.BI \-o\  dir
Output base (default:
.BR Submitted ).
.TP
.B \-verbose ,   \-n
See
.BR buildit .
.SS vers
Derive the Apple-style source version of
.IR path
(default:
.BR . ):
a trailing
.BR \-<digits>.<digits>... 
suffix if present, else
.BR git\ \-C\ dir\ describe\ --tags\ --long\ --always
(leading non-numeric prefix stripped, commit count appended as
.BR .N ),
else
.BR 1 .
.SS version
Print the tool version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B conf/projects.conf
Project database: Xcode aliases, dependencies, trains.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B XBS_CONF
Path to the project database (overrides the default search).
.TP
.B XBS_ROOTS_DIR
Roots base when
.B \-rootsDirectory
is not given.
.TP
.B XBS_CFLAGS
Fallback for
.BR RC_NONARCH_CFLAGS .
.TP
.B TMPDIR
Roots base when neither
.B \-rootsDirectory
nor
.B XBS_ROOTS_DIR
is set.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero on success.  Non-zero when a build, verification, or dependency check
fails.
